<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', position: 'relative', fontFamily: 'Source Han Sans CN, Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif' }}>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 12, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 30, left: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 34, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>改进离散映射差分进化（DMDE）</Text>
  </Box>
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 78, left: 60, fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>连续编码承载「UAV 归属 + 访问顺序」，差分算子的搜索方向由地理代价引导</Text>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 98, left: 60 }}>
    <svg width={1160} height={252} viewBox='0 0 1160 252'>
      <text x='20' y='26' font-size='16' font-weight='bold' fill='#0E3F8C'>离散层：三元组基因 (U_i, T_j, C(i,j)) —— 按 UAV 分段，每任务恰出现一次，基因总数恒 N</text>
      <rect x='60' y='42' width='96' height='42' rx='6' fill='#1E4FA8' />
      <text x='108' y='68' font-size='14' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle'>U0→T3</text>
      <rect x='160' y='42' width='112' height='42' rx='6' fill='#B5D4F4' />
      <text x='216' y='68' font-size='14' fill='#0E3F8C' text-anchor='middle'>T3→T7</text>
      <rect x='276' y='42' width='106' height='42' rx='6' fill='#B5D4F4' />
      <text x='329' y='68' font-size='14' fill='#0E3F8C' text-anchor='middle'>T7→T1</text>
      <text x='108' y='102' font-size='12' fill='#4A5568' text-anchor='middle'>起始基因 (id≥0)</text>
      <text x='266' y='102' font-size='12' fill='#4A5568' text-anchor='middle'>巡游基因 (id=−1)</text>
      <rect x='430' y='42' width='96' height='42' rx='6' fill='#1E4FA8' />
      <text x='478' y='68' font-size='14' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle'>U1→T2</text>
      <rect x='530' y='42' width='112' height='42' rx='6' fill='#B5D4F4' />
      <text x='586' y='68' font-size='14' fill='#0E3F8C' text-anchor='middle'>T2→T5</text>
      <rect x='646' y='42' width='96' height='42' rx='6' fill='#B5D4F4' />
      <text x='694' y='68' font-size='14' fill='#0E3F8C' text-anchor='middle'>T5→T8</text>
      <rect x='790' y='42' width='96' height='42' rx='6' fill='#1E4FA8' />
      <text x='838' y='68' font-size='14' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle'>U2→T6</text>
      <rect x='890' y='42' width='112' height='42' rx='6' fill='#B5D4F4' />
      <text x='946' y='68' font-size='14' fill='#0E3F8C' text-anchor='middle'>T6→T4</text>
      <rect x='1006' y='42' width='98' height='42' rx='6' fill='#D6DCE5' stroke='#8B97A8' strokeWidth='1' strokeDasharray='4 3' />
      <text x='1055' y='68' font-size='13' fill='#4A5568' text-anchor='middle'>T4→巢?</text>
      <text x='1055' y='102' font-size='12' fill='#8B97A8' text-anchor='middle'>终点不占编码维</text>
      <line x1='406' y1='40' x2='406' y2='106' stroke='#D6DCE5' strokeWidth='1.2' strokeDasharray='5 4' />
      <line x1='772' y1='40' x2='772' y2='106' stroke='#D6DCE5' strokeWidth='1.2' strokeDasharray='5 4' />
      <text x='30' y='152' font-size='15' font-weight='bold' fill='#0E3F8C'>连续层：固定布局代价值向量（DE 在此空间变异/交叉）</text>
      <text x='968' y='139' font-size='14' font-weight='bold' fill='#3D7BD9'>▼ 逆映射（4 步，见下）</text>
      <rect x='60' y='166' width='250' height='38' rx='6' fill='#1E4FA8' />
      <text x='185' y='190' font-size='14' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle'>起始基因代价 [0, K)</text>
      <rect x='314' y='166' width='480' height='38' rx='6' fill='#3D7BD9' />
      <text x='554' y='190' font-size='14' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle'>巡游基因代价（任务→任务） [K, N)</text>
      <rect x='798' y='166' width='304' height='38' rx='6' fill='#D6DCE5' strokeDasharray='5 4' />
      <text x='950' y='190' font-size='14' fill='#4A5568' text-anchor='middle'>终止段（主方案为空） [N, N+K)</text>
      <text x='30' y='234' font-size='14' fill='#4A5568'>差分算子作用于连续代价——其差分具有「三维航程差」的物理意义，搜索方向由地形代价引导；临时结果经逆映射还原为可行离散个体。</text>
    </svg>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 372, left: 60, width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', gap: 0 }}>
    {[
      { n: '1', t: '首任务匹配', d: '温度自适应 softmax：早期较大候选集软采样保多样性，随温度衰减收敛为贪心匹配' },
      { n: '2', t: '巡游边匹配', d: '按迭代行替换：以已访问任务为新起点行继续匹配——访问顺序真正进入进化搜索空间' },
      { n: '3', t: '扰动增强', d: '匹配后辅以 swap / insert / reverse 扰动，跳出局部结构' },
      { n: '4', t: '段结构规范化', d: '重建航次分段：起始基因按 UAV 升序、终止基因稳定落段末——保证 SRP 不变式' },
    ].map((s, i) => (
      <Box key={s.n} style={{ width: 280, flexDirection: 'column', paddingLeft: i === 0 ? 0 : 13 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 34, height: 34, borderRadius: 17, background: '#1E4FA8', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>{s.n}</Text>
          </Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>{s.t}</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8, paddingRight: 16 }}>{s.d}</Text>
      </Box>
    ))}
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 500, left: 60, width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8', borderRadius: 10, padding: '13px 18px' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>选择性 y=0 的决策位置：不占编码维度</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 5 }}>
        DE 空间中每个任务都被分配，「暂不执行」由解码后的可行性修复在评估端裁量（航程超限移除），并支持「任务少时并入更少机」的合并修复——空闲机零成本。
      </Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderLeft: '4px solid #0E3F8C', borderRadius: 10, padding: '13px 18px' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>Lamarckian 回写：只回写起始基因</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 5 }}>
        修复解只把首任务写回获胜个体的起始基因，巡游基因原样保留、绝不增删——基因长度恒定，这是「每任务恰出现一次」不变式下可安全落地的关键。
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 44, background: '#F7F9FC', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 40px', borderTop: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>动态滚动的多机巢多无人机协同任务分配 · 进展汇报</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>10 / 16</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
